  "description": "Fast track to the finish line.\n\nOur Lightest Performance Bike Yet\n\nIndustry leading carbon layup design puts Veyo’s ultra lightweight frame (860g: size medium) in the top 1% of performance race bikes on the market. Veyo punches above its lightweight class with a full UCI certification. Veyo is ready for a world tour, stage race, or draft legal triathlon not solely by its weight class, but also performance, durability, and safety.\n\nGo fast... like, really fast.\n\nNo rider likes wasting energy. Power transfer and acceleration are the keys to speed. Focusing largely on lateral stiffness at the rear axle, the Veyo ensures that every watt is optimized for pushing the rider forward. We did this with meticulous planning on Veyo’s carbon layup structure and frame tube shaping.\n\nUnleash Your Best\n\nVeyo is the ultimate do-everything performance road bike. For those looking for fun and speed while racing, training, or on their weekend club ride, Veyo is the bike for you.\n\nFeatherlight Aero\n\nBy using a truncated airfoil design on the downtube, seat tube, and seat post, Veyo makes the most of aero benefits in real world wind conditions while maximizing weight savings. Veyo is not only aero itself, but with size specific geometry, the rider can comfortably maintain an aero position longer and be faster overall.",
